   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I agree that renege would be useful.  As a first pass hack in the mean time - what about subdividing the queue into multiple processes, with a branch at each transition where the entity could either exit the system (if the wait time ended up being long) or continue?</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
